d pressure at visit was 125/75, and his weight was 191 pounds. He has been taking budesonide at a dosage of 3 mg and mesalamine at a dosage of 1.2 g. His Ulcerative colitis has been under control 16 years now, with the last colonoscopy performed 6.6 years ago. There were no new developments or concerns regarding his condition.\n\nThe patient's physical examination was unremarkable. His vital signs were within normal limits, and there were no signs of active inflammation or infection. He continues to follow a healthy diet and avoid known triggers that could preci"
